  "ID": "46690",
  "post_title": "125 aniversario de la Adoración Nocturna en Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-05-11 21:00:07",
  "post_name": "125-aniversario-de-la-adoracion-nocturna-en-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El obispo de la di&oacute;cesis Segorbe-Castell&oacute;n, Casimiro L&oacute;pez Llorente, ha oficiado casi a las 23 horas de este s&aacute;bado, 10 de mayo, una eucarist&iacute;a al aire libre en el Raval de Sant Josep de Onda, para conmemorar el 125&ordm; aniversario de la Adoraci&oacute;n Nocturna en el municipio.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9797.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Antes se ha rezado un rosario ante las m&aacute;s de 500 personas que se han congregado en la plaza, con c&aacute;nticos a del Coro Parroquial de la Asunci&oacute;n y m&uacute;sica a cargo de una peque&ntilde;a formaci&oacute;n orquestal, que tambi&eacute;n han participado durante la homil&iacute;a.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9865.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Despu&eacute;s se ha trasladado la custodia, que presid&iacute;a la ceremonia, hasta la iglesia de la Asunci&oacute;n, bajo palio, por las calles que se hab&iacute;an engalanado por la tarde.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9715.jpg\" alt=\"img_9715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9717.jpg\" alt=\"img_9717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9760.jpg\" alt=\"img_9760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9761.jpg\" alt=\"img_9761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9765.jpg\" alt=\"img_9765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9766.jpg\" alt=\"img_9766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9767.jpg\" alt=\"img_9767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9768.jpg\" alt=\"img_9768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9769.jpg\" alt=\"img_9769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9770.jpg\" alt=\"img_9770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9771.jpg\" alt=\"img_9771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9772.jpg\" alt=\"img_9772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9773.jpg\" alt=\"img_9773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/125anysadoracionocturnaonda100514/img_9774.jpg\" alt=\"img_9774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /